LOCATION:https://www.recreation.gov/camping/campgrounds/232445
URL:https://www.recreation.gov/camping/campgrounds/232445
DESCRIPTION:Watchman Campground sites open 6 months before each arrival nig
 ht on Recreation.gov\, so March 2027 nights are bookable NOW (March 1 open
 ed Sept 1\, 2026\; March 31 opens Sept 30). Popular nights sell out. Book:
  https://www.recreation.gov/camping/campgrounds/232445\n\nPair with the An
 gels Landing permit: https://www.recreation.gov/permits/4675310 (2027 spri
 ng lottery dates not announced yet).\n\nMAPS\n- Zion official maps page (p
 ark map\, brochure\, pedestrian entrance map): https://www.nps.gov/zion/pl
 anyourvisit/maps.htm\n- Spring Information Guide PDF (shuttle route map sh
 owing South Entrance\, Visitor Center\, The Grotto/Angels Landing trailhea
 d\, Watchman and South Campgrounds): https://www.nps.gov/zion/planyourvisi
 t/upload/26-Spring-InfoGuide.pdf\n- Pedestrian entrance map and shuttle in
 fo: https://www.nps.gov/zion/planyourvisit/zion-canyon-shuttle-system.htm\
 n- Watchman Campground on Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/
 ?api=1&query=Watchman+Campground+Zion+National+Park\n- South Campground on
  Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=South+Campgr
 ound+Zion+National+Park\n- Zion Canyon Visitor Center (south entrance) on 
