 isitor+Center\n- Angels Landing trailhead (The Grotto\, shuttle stop 6) on
  Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=The+Grotto+T
 railhead+Zion+National+Park\n\nCAMPSITES\n- Watchman Campground (open year
 -round\, near the south entrance\, walk to the shuttle). Sites book 6 mont
 hs ahead: https://www.recreation.gov/camping/campgrounds/232445 (NPS page:
  https://www.nps.gov/zion/planyourvisit/watchman-campground.htm)\n- South 
