SUMMARY:Zion March 2027: Angels Landing spring lottery (watch for it to ope
 n)
LOCATION:https://www.recreation.gov/permits/4675310
URL:https://www.recreation.gov/permits/4675310
DESCRIPTION:ANGELS LANDING PERMIT (hikes March 1 to May 31\, 2027)\nApply (
 Spring lottery): https://www.recreation.gov/permits/4675310\nOfficial info
  and dates: https://www.nps.gov/zion/planyourvisit/angels-landing-hiking-p
 ermits.htm\n\nThe 2027 spring lottery dates are NOT announced yet. The 202
 6 spring lottery ran Feb 13 to Feb 25. One third-party guide says Jan 1 to
  Jan 20\, 2027\, so verify on the NPS page. The window is only about 12 da
 ys.\n\nHow it works: $6 non-refundable application\, up to 6 people\, rank
  up to 7 dates/times. Winners pay $3 per person. The confirmation email is
  your permit\, so screenshot it. Backup: day-before lottery on Recreation.
 gov\, 12:01 AM to 3 PM Mountain the day before. Hike starts at The Grotto 
 (shuttle stop 6).\n\nMAPS\n- Zion official maps page (park map\, brochure\
 , pedestrian entrance map): https://www.nps.gov/zion/planyourvisit/maps.ht
 m\n- Spring Information Guide PDF (shuttle route map showing South Entranc
